              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebr 3:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yehova winjo dwal mi lembe mu, e kwinyo nege, man ekwong’o, ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andha ng’atu acel de mbe i kind dhanu maeni mi dhanum’utuk maeni ma rac ma bineno ng’om maeca ma ber, m’akwong’o ya ami ni kwaruwu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndhu Kaleb ma wod Yefune; ebinene; man abimio ng’om m’enyono ire, man ni nyithindhe, kum elubo Yehova ku cwinye ceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’ecwiny unego Yehova bende i kuma ni kumwu, ewacu kumae, In bende ibimondo kuca ngo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yocuwa ma wod Nun, m’ucungo i weng’i, ebimondo kuca; dwok cwinye tek; kum ebiketho Israel ugame ni aba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ke nyithindho mu ma thindho, ma wuwacu bibedo ni amaci, man nyithindho mu, ma ceng’ maeni ng’eyong’ec umbe kugi mi gin ma ber kadi gin ma rac, gibimondo kuca, e abimie igi, man gibimwonye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento wun, wulokru, man wutug woth mu i langa yo ba Nam Makwar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wulund wuloko lembe man wuwacu ira kumae, Wadubo ni Yehova, wabiidho man wabikiedo, calku gin ceke ma Yehova Mungu mwa ng’olo iwa. E kewu ceke ng’atuman utwio jamtho pare mir ali i kume, e wutimo pio wuidho i ng’om gudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova wacu ira kumae, Wac igi kumae, Kud wuidhi, kadok akieda de; kum ani i kindwu ngo; wumaru goiru i wang’judegiwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno ayero iwu, man wuwinjo ngo; ento wujai kum lembang’ola pa Yehova, man wutingru, e wuidho i ng’om gudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Juamori, m’ubedo i ng’om gudi maeca, gicori i wiwu, man giriemowu, calu kic timo, e gigoyowu piny i Seir, cil kum Horma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E wudwogo wuywak de i wang’ Yehova; ento Yehova winjo dwendwu ngo, kadi ithe de eciko iwu ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno wubedo i Kadec nindo dupa, calku nindo ma wubedo kuca.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
